                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use this report:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "From this page, you can set filters that will be applied throughout the report.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On each page, you can change the filters rather than doing so by navigating back to this page. To access the filters on each page, click the menu icon in the top left-hand corner. Any changes you make will be reflected on all pages.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "If you wish to reset the filters and set them back to default, you can click the X button in the top right-hand corner from any page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "At the bottom of each page there is a text box detailing any filters that have explicitly been applied. If nothing is showing for a filter, it means that ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "all",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
